Package: vicvisits
Title: Compare Victorian Public Library Visits per Resident
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sum Yee", "Chong", email = "scho0107@student.monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for comparing public library visits per resident
    across Victorian library services from 2022-23 to 2024-25.
    Includes data prepared from the Public Libraries Victoria Annual
    Statistical Survey, functions for comparing library services with
    statewide benchmarks, and an interactive Shiny application for
    exploring results.
